// Syncthing ignore rules for the Kernel Panic design vault.
// See vault/00-index/vault-conventions.md for vault rules proper.

// Symlinks that point outside the vault. They resolve only inside a full
// repo checkout (pipeline/art/done and .claude/agent-memory), so syncing
// them standalone would land broken links on every other device.
/_attachments/art
/80-crew/memory

// Per-device Obsidian UI state. Syncing these makes two machines fight
// over pane layout and scroll position on every focus change.
/.obsidian/workspace.json
/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

// Platform and editor debris.
.DS_Store
.trash
